              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 30:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze mu mwaka w’icumi na rimwe, mu kwezi kwa gatatu, ku musi wa mbere w’ukwo kwezi, ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryanjeko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riti Mwana w’umuntu, barira Farawo umwami wa Egiputa, n’ ishengero ryiwe, uti Ni nde munganya kuba agahambaye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehe rāba, Umwashuri yari nk’igiti c’isederi c’i Lebanoni c’amashami meza, c’igitūtu kinini, kandi c’ inganzamarumpu, ubushorishori bgaco bgashika mu bicu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 17:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Catungwa n’amazi, amazi menshi yaragikuza: inzūzi zatembera irya n’ino y’aho catewe, zikarekurira imigende yazo ku biti vyose vyo mu gahinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 17:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.4.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 4:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co catumye uburebure bgaco bushirwa hejuru y’ibiti vyose vyo mu gahinga; n’ amasango yaco agatagarara, n’ amashami yaco agashibuka kubgo kugira amazi menshi ayakuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 17:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 4:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’ibiguruka vyose vyo mu kirēre bikārika mu mashami yaco; n’ ibikōko vyose vyo mw ishamba bikavyarira ivyana vyavyo musi y’amashami yaco, n’amahanga yose ahambaye akibera mu gitūtu caco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko cabaye ciza mu kuba agahambaye, no mu gushibuka kw’amashami yaco: kukw imizi yaco yar’ ishōreye mu mazi menshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.28.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 28:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasederi yandi yo mw itongo ry’Imana nta yashobora kucababa; n’imiberoshi ntiyaruha ingana n’ amasango yaco, cank’ imyarumoni ngw ihwane n’amashami yaco; kandi nta giti co mw itongo ry’ Imana cari gihwanije na co ubgiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakigize ciza kubg’ isinzi ry’amashami yaco, bitume ibiti vyose vyo muri Edeni, vyari mw itongo ry’Imana, bikigirira ishari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
