              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 5:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Ko cabaye kirekire, ubushorishori bgaco bugashika mu bicu, kand’ uburebure bgaco bugatuma umutima waco wishira hejuru: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuko rero nzokigabura mu kuboko kw’umuhizi wo mu mahanga; azokigira ukw agomba; nacirukanye ngihōye ivyaha vyaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.28.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 28:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.32.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.4.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 4:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abantu b’akavantara b’agaterabgoba bo mu mahanga baragiciye, bagisiga ngaho: amashami yaco asanzara ku misozi no mu myonga yose, n’ amasango yaco avunagurikira ku migende y’amazi yose yo mu gihugu; kand’ amahanga yose yo mw isi ava mu gitūtu caco agisiga ngaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.18.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 18:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.32.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 32:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibiguruka vyose vyo mu kirēre bizohundara kuri co aho cahomvagurikiye, n’ibikōko vyose vyo mw ishamba bizokwibera ku mashami yaco: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.26.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 26:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo hoye kugira igiti na kimwe co ku nkengēra y’amazi cishira hejuru kubg’ uburebure bgaco ubgaco, canke ngo gitume ubushorishori bgaco bushika mu bicu, canke ngo hagire ibihambaye vyo muri vyo bihagarara vyishimiye uburebure bgavyo, ari vyo vyose bitungwa n’amazi: kuko vyose vyatanzwe ngo bipfe, bije i bgina i kuzimu, bifadikanijwe n’abantu buntu, n’ abamanuka baja muri rwa rwobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
