          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, at’ Umusi camanuka kija i kuzimu, nageze ko kiborogerwa; natumye mw idamba hitwikira kubgaco, mbuza inzūzi zaho gutemba, n’amazi menshi arahagarikwa; ntuma i Lebanoni hakigandarira, ibiti vyose vyo mu gahinga bigakabirana kubgaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
