            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natumye amahanga ashirwa mu gatengo no kwumva ugusenyerana kwaco, igihe nagishiburira i kuzimu hamwe n’abamanuka baja muri rwa rwobo; maz’ ibiti vyose vyo muri Edeni, n’ivyateretswe bisumba ibindi ubgiza vy’i Lebanoni, mber’ ibitungwa n’amazi vyose, bimarirwa umubabaro aho bir’ i kuzimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
