          "text": "Mu biti vyo muri Edeni n’ ikihe munganya kugira icubahiro no kuba agahambaye? Yamar’ uzomanukanwa hamwe n’ibiti vyo muri Edeni ushike i kuzimu: uzoryama hagati mu batākebge, hamwe n’abāriritswe n’inkota. Uwo ni we Farawo n’ishengero ryiwe ryose, ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize.",
